; Render Office and Crew records: domains registered, DNS verification pending.
; Apply only after reviewing existing records with these names.
; Use DNS only while verifying in Render.
$ORIGIN mowmatter.com.
$TTL 300
office IN CNAME mowmatter-office.onrender.com.
crew IN CNAME mowmatter-crew.onrender.com.
; Main domain requires additional Render domain slots before changing its DNS.
; Proposed later: @ CNAME mowmatter.onrender.com. (Cloudflare apex flattening)
; Proposed later: www CNAME mowmatter.onrender.com.
